---
name: Reduce HarfangLab ECS documents for a SIEM
description: |
  Drains the Elastic pull export of a HarfangLab Manager every minute and
  reduces the volume of the ECS documents: network connections and URL
  requests become summaries, process starts and library loads become
  deduplicated documents, and all other documents pass through unchanged.
---

every 1min {
  harfanglab::fetch "https://example.hurukai.io:8443",
    token=secret("harfanglab-api-token"),
    format="ecs"
}
harfanglab::ecs::reduce
